{"t":"ARES","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"Ares Management Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","employees":3967,"hq":"Los Angeles, CA, United States","website":"https://www.ares.com","summary_en":"Ares Management Corporation operates as an alternative asset manager. Its Direct Lending Group segment provides financing solutions to small-to-medium sized companies. The company's Private Equity Group segment specializes in early venture, turnaround, mid venture, late venture, recapitalization, growth capital, middle market, mezzanine, distressed and growth buyouts. The firm seeks to invest in healthcare, services, energy, industrials and consumer. The firm seeks to takes majority, minority and shared-control investments primarily in under-capitalized companies in North America, Europe, Asia Pacific, Southeast Asia and Australia. Its Real Estate Group segment invests in new developments and the repositioning of assets, with a focus on control or majority-control investments; and originates and invests in a range of self-originated financing opportunities for middle-market owners and operators of commercial real estate. The firm prefers to invest between $1 million and $500 million in companies having EBITDA between $10 million and $250 million and debt investment value between $10 million and $100 million. Ares Management Corporation was founded in 1997 and is based in Los Angeles, California with additional offices in North America, Europe and Asia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ares Management Corporation은 대체 자산 관리자로 운영됩니다. Direct Lending Group 부문은 중소기업에 금융 솔루션을 제공합니다. 회사의 사모 펀드 그룹 부문은 초기 벤처, 턴어라운드, 중간 벤처, 후기 벤처, 자본 확충, 성장 자본, 중간 시장, 메자닌, 부실 및 성장 매수를 전문으로 합니다. 이 회사는 의료, 서비스, 에너지, 산업재 및 소비자 분야에 투자하려고 합니다. 이 회사는 북미, 유럽, 아시아 태평양, 동남아시아 및 호주의 자본이 부족한 기업에 주로 다수, 소수 및 공유 통제 투자를 추구합니다. Real Estate Group 부문은 지배 또는 다수 지배 투자에 중점을 두고 새로운 개발 및 자산 재배치에 투자합니다. 중간 시장 소유주와 상업용 부동산 운영자를 위한 다양한 자체 금융 기회를 창출하고 투자합니다. 이 회사는 EBITDA가 1천만 달러에서 2억 5천만 달러 사이이고 부채 투자 가치가 1천만 달러에서 1억 달러 사이인 회사에 100만 달러에서 5억 달러 사이의 투자를 선호합니다. Ares Management Corporation은 1997년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 로스앤젤레스에 본사를 두고 있으며 북미, 유럽 및 아시아에 추가 지사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":133.98,"mcap":44451340288.0,"pe":109.819664,"fpe":19.199627,"peg":0.9906,"ps":8.924775,"pb":12.14577,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":4.04,"beta":1.507,"hi52":181.19,"lo52":95.8},"fin":{"rev":4980667904.0,"rev_g":-0.187,"eps_g":-0.817,"gross":1.0,"op":0.028900001,"net":0.086899996,"roe":null,"fcf":null,"cash":1852358016.0,"debt":14872607744.0,"de":172.378,"eps":1.22,"feps":6.97826},"own":{"short":0.1459,"inst":0.93754,"insider":0.11165},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":146.55,"median":142.5,"high":171.0,"low":129.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.95,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":7,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":7,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":154.0,"priorPriceTarget":155.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":158.0,"priorPriceTarget":159.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":141.0,"priorPriceTarget":136.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":171.0,"priorPriceTarget":168.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Keefe, Bruyette & Woods","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","curr